    width: 1093
    height: 1639
    caption: A map of Israeli bombing during the Second Lebanon War. Baalbek was a
      major target, with more than 70 bombs dropped.
  - file: Baalbek_1.png
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Baalbek_1.png/250px-Baalbek_1.png
    width: 1072
    height: 1580
    caption: 1911 diagram of the ruins after the Puchstein excavations. (Facing
      SW, with the Temple of Jupiter labelled "Temple of the Sun")
  - file: Pano_Baalbek_1.jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Pano_Baalbek_1.jpg/1280px-Pano_Baalbek_1.jpg
    width: 24726
    height: 5000
    caption: The Great Court of ancient Heliopolis's temple complex
  - file: David_Roberts_(1796-1864)_-_The_Gateway_to_the_Great_Temple_at_Baalbec_-_03-842_-_Royal_Academy_of_Arts.jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/David_Roberts_%281796-1864%29_-_The_Gateway_to_the_Great_Temple_at_Baalbec_-_03-842_-_Royal_Academy_of_Arts.jpg/250px-David_Roberts_%281796-1864%29_-_The_Gateway_to_the_Great_Temple_at_Baalbec_-_03-842_-_Royal_Academy_of_Arts.jpg
    width: 968
    height: 1200
    caption: The Gateway to the Great Temple at Baalbec by David Roberts, 1841
