== Twin towns

Baalbek is [[ twinned | twin-towns-and-sister-cities ]] with:

- [[ Bari ]], Italy
- [[ L'Aquila ]], Italy
- [[ Bergama ]], Turkey
- [[ Thrace ]], Greece
- [[ Yogyakarta | yogyakarta-city ]], Indonesia[[ ^200 ]]
- [[ Qazvin ]], Iran

